user_prompt:
Extract coder facts from the chart canonical package and claim context. Every fact you return must include evidence_refs referencing excerpt_id values from chart_canonical_package. If a fact has no direct excerpt evidence, set evidence_refs to an empty array. Do not return any fact without evidence_refs. When capturing patient age, include months whenever available (e.g., 1 year 3 months). Return ONLY this JSON object (no markdown, no extra text):
{
  "coder_facts_package": {
    "patient_context": {},
    "encounter_facts": {},
    "services": {},
    "quality_measure_facts": {},
    "coding_readiness": {"missing_inputs": [], "conflicts": []}
  }
}

